{{Quote|text=Nice to meet you, [Farmer's Name]! I'm Scarlett, a friend of this [[Sophia|dork]]. Gettin' into the farming business? It's tough work. I live in Grampleton with my papa. He's over at Marnie's with the truck loading up a bunch of milk and wool.}}
'''Scarlett''' is a [[Villagers|villager]] who lives at 106 Pondwood Road in the [[Pondwood Suburbs]]. She is one of the 7 marriage candidates added by Stardew Valley Expanded.

The player first meets Scarlett during [[Sophia|Sophia's]] 2-Hearts event, where Scarlett is visiting while her dad buys animal product goods at Marnie's. Scarlett and Sophia don't get to see each other often but stay close through calls and texts. Scarlett is a very supportive friend; she often brings Sophia's favorite meal, [[Grampleton Orange Chicken]], and she navigates Sophia's depression and grief with compassion.

Scarlett becomes a giftable NPC after viewing Sophia's 8-Hearts event. The player must also have either repaired the Community Center or completed the Joja development form. She begins showing up to Pelican Town festivals and appears at the Egg Festival, Luau, Stardew Valley Fair, and Spirit's Eve.

{{TOC|limit=2}}

== Schedule ==
Scarlett works as a farmhand for Andy in the spring and for Susan in the summer.

In the fall, if the player is married to Sophia, Scarlett takes the train from Grampleton to help Sophia with the fall grape harvest. She works as a farmhand on Monday, Tuesday, and Wednesday throughout the whole season, staying at Sophia's until she leaves on Thursday. She does not work at the vineyard on Fall 4; on this day, she stays at home.

