{{QuotesTableRow|title= Tuesdays, with 0 hearts|quote= My papa cherishes his pickup truck. It's like his most prized possession. Even though I have my driver's license, he won't let me take it out. *sigh* Maybe someday. I'd like to take a trip somewhere.}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Fridays, with 2 hearts|quote= Sorry my room is kinda messy. So, you're here in Pondwood! Is there anything you want to do? Oh! I can show you my graphic novel collection! I've been collecting since I was like seven years old. It all started when I took a wrong turn at a public library and found what I thought were picture books!}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Mondays, with 4 hearts|quote=Not gonna lie, I'm like low key jealous of Sophia's crafts room. My papa is kind enough to let me use his work bench in the garage for my projects. The sewing machine in my room was a hand-me-down from a close family friend. It does the job!}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Spring, Friday, with 8 hearts|quote= You know, I've never really been interested in going to college. It's something my papa wants me to do. To get an 'education'... I'm more of a 'hands-on approach' type of gal.}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Fall, Sunday, with 8 hearts|quote= We should totally have a slumber party sometime! I know this really good popcorn seasoning recipe. I learned it from Hank. It's a mix of coconut curry, gingerbread, and cinnamon sugar.}}
{{TableEnd}}</div></div>

